  "label": "The text 'trump is still your president' is mapped onto the person in the wizard costume",
  "description": "The bottom text 'trump is still your president' asserts political authority and loyalty. The person in the wizard costume, despite their absurd or mocking appearance, is visually positioned as the embodiment of the message — the 'president' or the figure who remains in power regardless of dissent. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual concept of 'president' is visually instantiated by the person in the costume, even though the costume is metaphorical and ironic.",
